      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Three Apps Script projects",
      "items": [
        "Deploy owns the Roster and Layout backend. Do not create a fourth script for Roster.",
        "Contacts Pages and Calendar Pages call their matching script directly; paths are grouped here for readability."
